      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "In 67 patients with longstanding anterior knee pain intra-osseous phlebography of the patella and arthroscopy of the knee were performed. No statistical correlation could be demonstrated between the delayed drainage of the contrast medium from the patellar veins and the degree of damage to the patellar cartilage."},
